{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach {{BUSINESS_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} for integrative, whole-person care and educational guidance.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg-1: linear-gradient(180deg, #f4fbff 0%, #f9f7ff 100%);
      --accent: #3b82f6;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --card: #ffffff;
      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius: 12px;
      --maxwidth: 1100px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
      color-scheme: light;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg-1);}
    .stage{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;}

    /* Decorative SVG pattern layered behind content. A dedicated file will live at assets/img/pattern.svg */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.9}
    .pattern-wrap svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}

    header{width:100%;z-index:10;padding:28px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;}
    .nav{max-width:var(--maxwidth);margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
    .brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
    .brand h1{margin:0;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.2px}
    .brand p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    nav ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:#0f172a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.cta{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#6ee7b7);color:white}

    main{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxwidth);margin:18px auto;padding:28px;box-sizing:border-box;position:relative;z-index:5}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:20px}

    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.9), rgba(250,250,255,0.85));backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(16,24,40,0.06)}
    .hero-card h2{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px}
    .hero-card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .contact-info{margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
    .info-card{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(16,24,40,0.04);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}
    .info-card b{font-size:14px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    .form-card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(13,17,23,0.06)}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],input[type=tel],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6e9ef;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    .row .col{flex:1}
    .submit{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border:none;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
    .link-like{background:transparent;border:0;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}
    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    aside{position:relative}
    .map{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#eef6ff,#f7fff9);height:220px;border-radius:12px;padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.6)}
    .practitioner{margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:10px}
    .practitioner h3{margin:0}
    .hours{margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    footer{width:100%;padding:24px 20px;box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:30px}
    .copyright{max-width:var(--maxwidth);margin:0 auto;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    @media (max-width:920px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .contact-info{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      nav ul{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- Inline decorative SVG: unique pattern. A copy is expected at assets/img/pattern.svg for reuse. -->
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none" viewBox="0 0 800 600">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#e6f6ff" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f8fff6" />
        </linearGradient>
        <pattern id="dots" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2.5" fill="#dff6ff" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g1)" />
      <g opacity="0.85">
        <rect x="-100" y="-50" width="650" height="400" rx="60" fill="url(#dots)" transform="rotate(-12 200 120)" />
        <path d="M600 0 C700 120 760 240 840 320 L840 600 L0 600 L0 320 C120 200 220 60 360 40 C460 28 520 10 600 0 Z" fill="#f1fbff" opacity="0.9"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="stage">
    <header>
      <div class="nav">
        <div class="brand">
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <p>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
        </div>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <ul>
            <li><a href="index.html">Welcome</a></li>
            <li><a href="services.html">Our Care</a></li>
            <li><a href="conditions.html">Common Concerns</a></li>
            <li><a href="approach.html">How We Work</a></li>
            <li><a href="pricing.html">Investment</a></li>
            <li><a href="about.html">Team</a></li>
            <li><a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="grid">
        <section class="hero-card">
          <h2>Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h2>
          <p>We provide integrative, whole-person assessments and educational guidance to help you make informed choices about your health. Contact us to request an intake, ask about services, or discuss a personalized plan.</p>

          <div class="contact-info" role="group" aria-label="Contact methods">
            <div class="info-card">
              <b>Call or text</b>
              <div class="small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
              <div class="muted-note">Responsive hours: Mon–Fri 9:00–5:00</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-card">
              <b>Email</b>
              <div class="small"><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
              <div class="muted-note">We aim to reply within 48 business hours.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
            <button onclick="document.getElementById('contact-name').focus()" class="submit">Start a message</button>
            <a class="link-like" href="book.html">Request a visit</a>
          </div>

          <p class="muted-note" style="margin-top:12px">Note: Our guidance emphasizes lifestyle, nutrition, mind-body practices and selective diagnostics. We do not promise cures; outcomes vary and are discussed during intake.</p>
        </section>

        <aside>
          <div class="map" aria-hidden="true">
            <!-- Stylized map placeholder with accessible label provided below -->
            <svg width="140" height="120" viewBox="0 0 140 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Map location illustration">
              <rect x="0" y="0" width="140" height="120" rx="12" fill="#eaf8ff" />
              <circle cx="40" cy="50" r="8" fill="#60a5fa" />
              <circle cx="80" cy="45" r="6" fill="#34d399" />
              <path d="M20 90 C40 70, 60 70, 80 90" stroke="#93c5fd" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;text-align:center">
              <div style="font-weight:700">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
              <div class="small">Street-level clinic and telehealth options available</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="practitioner">
            <h3>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</h3>
            <div class="hours">Clinical hours by appointment. New-patient intakes typically 60–90 minutes; follow-ups 30–45 minutes.</div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">We emphasize shared decision-making, education, and measurable goals. Optional labs and referrals are discussed as educational tools rather than one-size-fits-all solutions.</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <section style="margin-top:20px" class="form-card" aria-labelledby="contact-form-title">
        <h2 id="contact-form-title">Send a message</h2>
        <form id="contact-form">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="col">
              <label for="contact-name">Full name</label>
              <input id="contact-name" name="name" type="text" required placeholder="Your name" />
            </div>
            <div class="col">
              <label for="contact-phone">Phone</label>
              <input id="contact-phone" name="phone" type="tel" placeholder="Optional" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <label for="contact-email">Email</label>
          <input id="contact-email" name="email" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />

          <label for="contact-reason">Reason for contact</label>
          <select id="contact-reason" name="reason">
            <option>New patient intake</option>
            <option>Follow-up question</option>
            <option>Telehealth inquiry</option>
            <option>Billing / insurance</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>

          <label for="contact-message">Message</label>
          <textarea id="contact-message" name="message" placeholder="Briefly describe your concern or question"></textarea>

          <label style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center"><input type="checkbox" id="consent" required /> <span class="small">I consent to receive communications from {{BUSINESS_NAME}} about my inquiry. I understand this is not an emergency channel.</span></label>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:6px">
            <button type="submit" class="submit">Send</button>
            <button type="button" class="link-like" id="clear-btn">Clear</button>
            <span style="margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></span>
          </div>
          <div id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
        </form>
      </section>

      <footer>
        <div class="copyright">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Information provided is educational and not a substitute for individualized clinical assessment. For emergencies, call local emergency services.</div>
      </footer>
    </main>
  </div>

  <script>
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    const form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
    const status = document.getElementById('form-status');
    const clearBtn = document.getElementById('clear-btn');

    clearBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      form.reset();
      status.textContent = '';
    });

    form.addEventListener('submit', async (e)=>{
      e.preventDefault();
      status.textContent = 'Sending...';

      const data = {
        name: form.name.value.trim(),
        phone: form.phone.value.trim(),
        email: form.email.value.trim(),
        reason: form.reason.value,
        message: form.message.value.trim()
      };

      // If a PRIMARY_CTA_URL is provided, attempt a POST. Otherwise fall back to mailto link.
      const endpoint = "{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}";
      try{
        if(endpoint && endpoint.length>0){
          // Attempt to POST JSON. Endpoint should accept application/json.
          const res = await fetch(endpoint, {
            method: 'POST',
            headers: {'Content-Type':'application/json'},
            body: JSON.stringify(data)
          });
          if(res.ok){
            status.textContent = 'Message sent. We will reply within 48 business hours.';
            form.reset();
          } else {
            status.textContent = 'Unable to send via form. Opening email client as fallback.';
            openMailto(data);
          }
        } else {
          openMailto(data);
        }
      } catch(err){
        console.error(err);
        status.textContent = 'Network issue. Opening email client as fallback.';
        openMailto(data);
      }

      function openMailto(d){
        const subject = encodeURIComponent('Contact from '+d.name+' — '+d.reason);
        const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+d.name+'\nPhone: '+d.phone+'\nEmail: '+d.email+'\n\nMessage:\n'+d.message);
        window.location.href = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the contact page and developer notes for the holistic/integrative clinic template.

Files included:
- contact.html — The contact page users will use to message the clinic, request bookings, or find contact information. It includes:
  - Accessible contact form with client-side validation and a fetch POST to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} when set; falls back to mailto:{{EMAIL}}.
  - Inline decorative SVG background (unique pattern). A reusable copy should be placed at assets/img/pattern.svg for other pages to reference.
  - Header/navigation with varied labels to avoid repetition across templates.
  - Practitioner card using placeholders: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} and {{CREDENTIALS}}.
  - Placeholders used throughout: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Editing notes:
- Replace placeholders in the HTML with actual values. Keep the double-curly placeholders if you integrate with a templating system.
- If you provide an endpoint in {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, ensure it accepts POST JSON with Content-Type: application/json. If not provided, the form will open the user's email client.
- A dedicated SVG file is recommended at assets/img/pattern.svg. The inline pattern in contact.html is unique for this template and should be kept in sync if you centralize assets.

Accessibility & legal:
- The page includes aria labels for navigation and status messages for form submission.
- The content avoids medical guarantees and includes an educational / nondisclaimer note. Do not remove the emergency instructions.

Styling & assets:
- Visual richness is implemented with CSS gradients, shadows, and the inline SVG pattern. No external fonts or CDNs are referenced.
- To adapt the color scheme, edit the CSS variables at the top of contact.html.

Deployment:
- Copy contact.html into your build or server static folder. Ensure other pages referenced in navigation (index.html, services.html, conditions.html, approach.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html) exist alongside it.

If you need alternate contact form handling (e.g., Netlify Forms, Zapier, or a serverless function), replace the fetch call with the appropriate integration and keep the accessibility features intact."}
BUNDLE_END
